  "prefLabel": "Mhp 303.04 Other Requirements for Pastoral Psychotherapists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mhp 303.04 Other Requirements for Pastoral Psychotherapists. All applicants for pastoral psychotherapist license shall:\n\n(a) Take and achieve a passing grade on the NHPPA Pastoral Psychotherapist Licensure Examination: Clinical Theory and Practice; and\n\n(b) Hold an active membership in the New Hampshire Pastoral Psychotherapist Association.\n\nSource. #10857, eff 6-24-15 (formerly Mhp 302.11); renumbered by #13786 (formerly Mhp 303.03); ss by #14464, eff 2-17-26, EXPIRES 2-17-36",
